window.products.push({"id":162396,"name":"Ice Maker Countertop, Portable Ice Maker Machine, 28lbs/24Hrs, 6 Mins/9 Pcs Bullet Ice, Mini Ice Maker with Self Cleaning, Time Reservation Function, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ct6dq2qLL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Efficient Ice Making: Rottogoon countertop ice maker for home only takes 6-12 minutes to make 9 bullet-shaped ice cubes. It even can produce up to 26-33 pounds of ice per day, which enables you to have fresh ice every day. Remember, before the first use, keep it upright for 12 hours. During the initial cycle, the ice cubes may be slightly thinner and the production may be slower. However, with subsequent cycles, the ice cubes will become thicker and the production speed will increase. Portable & Compact: The ice machine maker countertop has wide applications with compact sizes of 14.1\"*9.05\"*11.8\",9 kg with a 2L water tank. Sleek and compact, the ROTTOGOON small ice maker seamlessly fits into any kitchen, tea shop, office, and so on. Tips: Please add the drinking water to the water tank. Two sizes of ice cubes for choice: Use the small ice cubes to preserve food freshness, chill beer, or create ice packs. The large ice cubes are perfect for enhancing the flavor of your beverages. The bullet-shaped design of the ice cubes provides a practical advantage, efficiently cooling your drinks without diluting them. This means you can maintain the full flavor of your beverages, whether it's a refreshing soda or your favorite whiskey. Hands-Free Self-Cleaning: Don't worry about mold anymore, the self cleaning ice makers countertop lets you hands-free. Under standby mode, just add water and press the ice-making button for 3 seconds can clean the machine. Made of high-quality stainless steel and food-grade ABS materials, for long-lasting durability and superior safety to produce healthy and clean ice cubes. Cleaning the ice machine maker periodically can help to remove harmful substances, ensuring you are eating safely. Human-machine Interaction: ROTTOGOON touch-control LED Display panel is smarter, simpler, and more durable. This high-end panel includes a time reservation function on the bullet ice maker, which lets you set a start time for ice-making. This feature helps you make enough ice without having to wait. Besides, the LED panel can display the timer, add water, and full ice, so you don't have to check them manually. It's a helpful assistant for you. Also, we provide a 1-year support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ct6dq2qLL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROTTOGOON","source_asin":"B0BZZ5W9JS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-162396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZZ5W9JS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZZ5W9JS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
