window.products.push({"id":162549,"name":"Clikstand Windscreen S2-c Stainless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FdUYTpTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Clikstand S-2 is a lightweight, collapsible, multi-fuel pot-stand designed for use with alcoholburners, solid fuels or for wood burning. The patented design is made in the USA, from the highest quality stainless steel. Its three point design provides a stable platform for cooking in the outdoors. / Clikstand S-2G: Modified to accept gas burners (specifically the Gas Burner and Multifuel Burner made by Trangia) . The S-2G has a slot on one side to allow clearance for the gas hose/control as well as an additional set of slots to raise the burner platform to the required height for the gas burners. / Appalachian Combo: Includes Clikstand S-2 and amp; Windscreen. Weight: 4.6 oz. / Windscreen S-2: Can be used with large and small pots. It improves the performance of the S-2 by blocking wind and reflecting heat onto the cook pot. When not in use it can be rolled up and placed inside of a cookpot or wrapped around a fuel or water bottle. Windscreen is made from ultra-thin tempered stainless steel for lightweight and durability. It is suitable for pots up to 5.9 inches in diameter. / p Solid Fuel Adapter: and nbsp;A small, circular tray stamped from and nbsp;high quality tempered stainless steel. The tray covers the burner hole on any Clikstand to allow the easy use of solid fuel tablets such as Esbit or hexamine. /p / p Evernew Adapter: and nbsp; and nbsp;Increases stability of the and nbsp;Evernew titanium burner when used with the Clikstand and Trangia stove systems. The Evernew titanium burner is slightly smaller in diameter than the Trangia burner. The adapter ensures a stable fit of the Evernew titanium burner. Adapter made of stainless steel. /p / Weight: 3.3 oz (s-2), 4.6 oz (combo)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FdUYTpTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRYZOO","source_asin":"B00BEGSPBU","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-162549","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BEGSPBU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BEGSPBU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
