window.products.push({"id":162611,"name":"EALLMALL Range Hood Insert 30 Inch, 900 CFM Range Hood Insert, Gesture Sensing/Touch Control Insert Range Hood, 4-Speed Vent Hood Insert, Ducted/Ductl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zavhkQE9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【DESIGNED FOR HEAVY-DUTY COOKING】: This luxurious range hood insert makes cooking more appealing. The innovative double-sided smoking design for excellence increases the effective extraction rate by 30% and improves smoke extraction by 50%. Stir-frying, pan-frying, and deep-frying are a breeze. the 900 CFM powerful suction captures all the smoke in 1.5 min with no escaping. ✅【NOISE REDUCTION】:This range hood insert 30 inch has a noise-canceling motor and an aerodynamic impeller that reduces friction and noise. Running as quietly as a whisper. Min.42 dB, soft tones, and low volume make cooking a joy while never disturbing your baby's sweetest dreams. ✅【MORE INTELLIGENT & CONVENIENT】: Begin your fantastic culinary journey by; You can easily turn ON/OFF/SHIFT by waving motion activation and remote control using infrared connection technology. The delayed shut-off function absorbs all residual smoke. Adjustable provide clear, non-dazzling illumination. More options, this vent hood insert meets your requirements. Feel free to be picky! ✅【EXCELLENT FILTERING】: This hood insert uses an excellent filtering structure and grease absorption to easily extract fumes, removing up to 98.7% of the grease. With a charcoal filter, it is simple to convert to ductless. These filters capture grease particles and eliminate odors. Dishwasher-safe baffle filters are simple to take apart and clean. ✅【HUMANIZED DESIGN & SERVICE】: The built-in 1.5 L super-large oil cup reduces cleaning frequency and eliminates oil dripping, allowing the kitchen to stay clean. We have after-sales service centers in Washington,Texas, and New York. Motors and parts should have a 5-year limited warranty. Provide convenient 24-hour after-sales consultation and service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zavhkQE9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EALLMALL","source_asin":"B0CCJ8ZC6G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-162611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CCJ8ZC6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CCJ8ZC6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
