window.products.push({"id":162753,"name":"Dryer Repair Kit Replacement Compatible with Samsung Dryer Include DC97-16782A Dryer Roller 6602-001655 Drum Belt DC93-00634A Idler Pulley Replace AP5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xqyrMhL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For Samsung Clothes Dryer Replacement Parts : Upgraded samsung Dryer Repair Kit Includes Dryer Roller DC97-16782A & Dryer Belt 6602-001655 & Idler Pulley DC93-00634A These parts fix the following symptoms: Samsung Dryer is squeaky, Noisy, Dryer Will not tumble or spin , Will Not Start DC97-16782A Dryer Rollers for samsung dryer Dryer drum roller assembly includes drum shaft and mounting clip. Both the front and rear rollers should be replaced in groups. When the bearing in the roller wears, no grease is needed.Because it will automatically lubricate. If your Samsung dryer is making odd noises, then checking and replacing the rollers may solve your problem. Make sure to unplug the dryer from the power source before beginning the replacement. DC93-00634A Dryer Idler Pulley The idler pulley has upgraded the material, retaining the original triangular manufacturing, fixed bearing. A matching screw.Fix the White belt wheel on the dc93-00634a Idler through this screw. When the dryer works, it is more stable and not easy to fall off. DC93-00634A includes the idler arm and the idler pulley that maintains tension on the drive belt, allowing the belt to turn.'''' 6602-001655 attaches to the motor pulley and causes the drum to spin as the motor is rotating. This goes between the drive motor and the dryer drum. The broken belt will cause the drum to not turn properly. You will need to pull your dryer away from the wall and use your Phillips screwdriver to remove the screws on the back. Fitment Example: DV209AEW DV210A DV218A DV219AEW DV220A DV306LEW DV328A DV330AEW DV331A DV332AEW DV337AEL DV350A DV361GWBEWR DV363GWBEUF DV36J4000EW DV395ET DV400EWHDWR DV405ETPAWR DV40J3000EW DV419A DV42H5000 DV42H5200 DV42H5400EW DV42H5600 DV448A DV456EWHDWR DV45H6300 DV45H7000 DV40J3000EW DV45H7200E DV45K6200EZ DV45K6200GZ DV45K6500 DV45K7600EW","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xqyrMhL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CYS Canopy","source_asin":"B09DBRXLVY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-162753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DBRXLVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DBRXLVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
