window.products.push({"id":162888,"name":"Reusable K Cups Coffee Pods Compatible with Ninja Dual Brew Coffee Maker, 4 Pack Reusable Coffee Filters Compatible with Ninja CFP301 CFP201 CFP400 Du","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719eWuYU4oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDES: 4 * K Cup Reusable Pods 1 * Clean Brush QUESTIONS & ANSWER: 1. Why the coffee pod has a small tear or a hole in the bottom mesh？ When put the coffee capsule into the pod adapter, align the indicator mark of the capsule and then put it in. The cover is marked with an arrow for easy calibration. (Do not put the capsule into the pod adapter first and then rotate it to align the hole position. This is the key to capsule damage!） 2. Why coffee sprayed everywhere during brewing? When using coffee capsules, the coffee machine's brewing basket and pod adapter need to be put in the coffee machine at the same time to brew normally. If you find that there is an extra coffee brewing basket around your machine, you need to confirm whether you use the coffee machine correctly! 3. It didn't fit my dualbrew my coffee maker. This capsule is only compatible with ‘three hole’ coffee machine(Specialized for CFP series, for example, please pay attention to distinguish CFP301 and CP301, they are completely different!), please confirm your coffee machine model before purchasing! Disclaimer: The part/product is not sponsored or endorsed by, or affiliated with the brands it fits, including Ninja.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719eWuYU4oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Piwerod","source_asin":"B0BQJ7V56S","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-162888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQJ7V56S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQJ7V56S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
